%% Bootstrap Initialization Sequence
%% US-E5-032: Wire Services Through DI Container
%% Shows step-by-step initialization with timing

sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant Bootstrap as Bootstrap Module
    participant Registry as Service Registry
    participant Container as DI Container
    participant Infra as Infrastructure
    participant Services as Business Services
    participant Health as Health Checks

    App->>Bootstrap: bootstrapApplication(config)
    activate Bootstrap

    Note over Bootstrap: Phase 1: Create Registry
    Bootstrap->>Registry: createServiceRegistry()
    Registry-->>Bootstrap: registry instance

    Note over Bootstrap: Phase 2: Register Services<br/>(~5-10ms)
    Bootstrap->>Registry: registerInfrastructureServices()
    Registry->>Registry: Logger, Config, DB, Redis
    Bootstrap->>Registry: registerSharedServices()
    Registry->>Registry: EventBus, Cache, Email, etc.
    Bootstrap->>Registry: registerContentServices()
    Registry->>Registry: 7 content services
    Bootstrap->>Registry: registerUserServices()
    Registry->>Registry: 5 user services
    Bootstrap->>Registry: registerPaymentServices()
    Registry->>Registry: 7 payment services
    Registry-->>Bootstrap: 29+ services registered

    Note over Bootstrap: Phase 3: Validate Dependencies<br/>(~1-2ms)
    Bootstrap->>Registry: validate()
    Registry->>Registry: Check circular deps
    Registry->>Registry: Check missing deps
    alt Validation Failed
        Registry-->>Bootstrap: errors
        Bootstrap-->>App: BootstrapResult (failed)
    end
    Registry-->>Bootstrap: validation OK

    Note over Bootstrap: Phase 4: Create Container<br/>(~1ms)
    Bootstrap->>Registry: createContainer()
    Registry->>Container: new ServiceContainer()
    Container-->>Registry: container instance
    Registry-->>Bootstrap: container

    Note over Bootstrap: Phase 5: Health Checks<br/>(~10-50ms)
    Bootstrap->>Health: performHealthChecks(container)
    Health->>Container: resolve(EventBusService)
    Container->>Infra: create EventBusService
    Infra-->>Container: instance
    Container-->>Health: service
    Health->>Health: await service.isHealthy()
    Health->>Container: resolve(CacheService)
    Container->>Infra: create CacheService
    Infra-->>Container: instance
    Container-->>Health: service
    Health->>Health: await service.healthCheck()
    Health->>Container: resolve(Database)
    Container-->>Health: db connection
    Health-->>Bootstrap: health results

    Note over Bootstrap: Phase 6: Setup Shutdown<br/>(~1ms)
    Bootstrap->>Bootstrap: setupGracefulShutdown(container)

    Note over Bootstrap: Total Time: ~20-70ms
    Bootstrap-->>App: BootstrapResult {<br/>success: true,<br/>container,<br/>timing,<br/>servicesRegistered: 29+<br/>}
    deactivate Bootstrap

    Note over App: Application Ready<br/>Services available for injection
